      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Railroads spurred growth: the Gulf, Colorado and Santa Fe line reached Rochelle in 1912, boosting the town\u2019s population.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        6,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rochelle%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The same Gulf, Colorado and Santa Fe tracks were abandoned in 1959, hastening Rochelle\u2019s decline.",
